      "url": "https://www.astrology.com/horoscope/daily/taurus.html",
      "ok": true,
      "source_date": "September 27, 2026",
      "text": "The Aries Moon and Saturn unite early this morning, dearest Taurus, unlocking new levels of the psyche. You'll require some alone time to process everything that rises to the surface, so don't hesitate to cancel plans and lay low. You'll have a better handle on where you're at mentally once Luna and Jupiter align this afternoon. Host a cozy lunch to discuss your discoveries while nurturing important bonds. Battle impulses that might send you backward when Mars squares Chiron before entering Leo this evening."
    },
