      "source_date": "Sunday, September 27, 2026",
      "text": "Take rest and try to relax as much as possible between work. Money position improves as delayed payments are recovered. You can get your own way with people if you turn on your charms and use your intelligence. Those who were very busy for the last few days will finally get to enjoy their own time. You might face a tough time in your marriage today."
